3. pubdate=&quot;&quot; was added in <a href="https://html5.org/r/3116">http://html5.org/r/3116</a> specifically to enable the conversion to an Atom feed. However, I'm virtually certain that no one has ever used it for that purpose because (a) no one seems to have noticed or cared that the conversion algorithm was removed and (b) when I tried implementing that algorithm in January I found and filed the kinds of bugs that seem to indicate that no one had done it before.

